{"speciesId":62,"names":{"fr":"Tartard","es":"Poliwrath","en":"Poliwrath","ja":"ニョロボン"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"red","text":"An adept swimmer at both the front crawl and breast stroke. Easily overtakes the best human swimmers."},{"language":"en","version":"blue","text":"An adept swimmer at both the front crawl and breast stroke. Easily overtakes the best human swimmers."},{"language":"en","version":"yellow","text":"Swims powerfully using all the muscles in its body. It can even overtake champion swimmers."},{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"This strong and skilled swimmer is even capable of crossing the Pacific Ocean just by kicking."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"Although an ener­ getic, skilled swimmer that uses all of its mus­ cles, it lives on dry land."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"It can use its well-developed arms and legs to run on the surface of the water for a split second."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"POLIWRATH’s highly developed, brawny muscles never grow fatigued, however much it exercises. It is so tirelessly strong, this POKéMON can swim back and forth across the Pacific Ocean without effort."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"POLIWRATH’s highly developed, brawny muscles never grow fatigued, however much it exercises. It is so tirelessly strong, this POKéMON can swim back and forth across the Pacific Ocean without effort."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"Its highly developed muscles never grow fatigued, however much it exercises. This POKéMON can swim back and forth across the Pacific Ocean without effort."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"An adept swimmer, it knows the front crawl, butterfly, and more. It is faster than the best human swimmers."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"A swimmer adept at both the front crawl and breaststroke. Easily overtakes the best human swimmers."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"With its extremely tough muscles, it can keep swimming in the Pacific Ocean without resting."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"With its extremely tough muscles, it can keep swimming in the Pacific Ocean without resting."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"With its extremely tough muscles, it can keep swimming in the Pacific Ocean without resting."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"This strong and skilled swimmer is even capable of crossing the Pacific Ocean just by kicking."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"Although an energetic, skilled swimmer that uses all of its muscles, it lives on dry land."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il possède de sacrés biscoteaux. Il peut parcourir sans relâche l’Océan Pacifique."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"With its extremely tough muscles, it can keep swimming in the Pacific Ocean without resting."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il possède de sacrés biscoteaux. Il peut parcourir sans relâche l’Océan Pacifique."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"With its extremely tough muscles, it can keep swimming in the Pacific Ocean without resting."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"With its extremely tough muscles, it can keep swimming in the Pacific Ocean without resting."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"With its extremely tough muscles, it can keep swimming in the Pacific Ocean without resting."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Il possède de sacrés biscoteaux. Il peut parcourir sans relâche l’océan Pacifique."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Tiene músculos muy desarrollados. Es capaz de nadar en el océano sin descanso."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"With its extremely tough muscles, it can keep swimming in the Pacific Ocean without resting."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"強靭な 筋肉を 持つ。 太平洋を 休むことなく 泳ぎ続けることが できるのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Excellent nageur, il pratique le crawl ou la nage papillon mieux qu’un champion olympique."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Experto nadador tanto a braza como a crol. Gana fácilmente a los nadadores profesionales."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"A swimmer adept at both the front crawl and breaststroke. Easily overtakes the best human swimmers."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"クロールや バタフライが 得意で オリンピックの 選手でも ぐんぐんと 追い抜いていく。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Les muscles solides et surdéveloppés de Tartard ne se fatiguent jamais, quels que soient les efforts qu’il produit. Ce Pokémon est tellement endurant qu’il peut traverser un océan à la nage avec une étonnante facilité."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Poliwrath tiene unos músculos fornidos y muy desarrollados, por lo que nunca se agota. Es tan fuerte e incansable que cruzar el océano a nado no le supone ningún esfuerzo."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Poliwrath’s highly developed, brawny muscles never grow fatigued, however much it exercises. It is so tirelessly strong, this Pokémon can swim back and forth across the ocean without effort."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"発達した 強靭な 筋肉は どんなに 運動しても 疲れる ことは ない。 太平洋も 軽く 横断 できるほどだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Les muscles solides et surdéveloppés de Tartard ne se fatiguent jamais, quels que soient les efforts qu’il produit. Ce Pokémon est tellement endurant qu’il peut traverser un océan à la nage avec une étonnante facilité."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Poliwrath tiene unos músculos fornidos y muy desarrollados, por lo que nunca se agota. Es tan fuerte e incansable que cruzar el océano a nado no le supone ningún esfuerzo."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Poliwrath’s highly developed, brawny muscles never grow fatigued, however much it exercises. It is so tirelessly strong, this Pokémon can swim back and forth across the ocean without effort."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"発達した 強靭な 筋肉は どんなに 運動しても 疲れる ことは ない。 太平洋も 軽く 横断 できるほどだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Les Tartard d’Alola nagent la brasse avec habileté. Beaucoup d’enfants apprennent à nager en les imitant."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"A los Poliwrath de Alola se les da de maravilla nadar a braza. Muchos niños imitan a este Pokémon para aprender a nadar."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"Poliwrath in the Alola region are strong swimmers that use the breaststroke. Many children learn to swim by imitating Poliwrath."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"アローラの ニョロボンは 平泳ぎが 得意。 ニョロボンの マネで 泳ぎを 学ぶ 子どもも 多い。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Il a un indice de masse grasse proche de zéro. Comme il est plein de muscles, il est très lourd et a dû apprendre à nager pour se déplacer."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"Tiene prácticamente un 0% de grasa corporal. Es un excelente nadador debido a la fuerza que posee, ya que su cuerpo es todo músculo."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"Its percentage of body fat is nearly zero. Its body is entirely muscle, which makes it heavy and forces its swimming prowess to develop."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"体脂肪率は 大体０％。 全身が 筋肉で 重いので 泳ぐ 力が 発達した。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Bien qu’il fasse partie des Pokémon de type Eau les plus doués pour la nage, il reste en général sur la terre ferme."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Pese a ser uno de los mejores nadadores entre los Pokémon acuáticos, pasa la mayor parte del tiempo en tierra firme."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"It’s quite a gifted swimmer, even among Water-type Pokémon, but it normally spends its time on land."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"みずポケモンの 中でも かなり 泳ぎは 達者な 部類 なのに 普段は 陸で 過ごしている。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Son impressionnante musculature a été sculptée par sa nage vigoureuse. Un direct du droit lui suffit à réduire un gros rocher en miettes."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Horas de nado han cincelado una musculatura impresionante, hasta el punto de ser capaz de pulverizar rocas de un puñetazo."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"The muscles it has developed through swimming are thick and powerful. When it lands a square punch, it can turn huge boulders to dust."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"泳ぎで 鍛えた 筋肉は 太く たくましい。 正拳突きで 大きな 岩も 粉々に する。"},{"language":"fr","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Son corps très musclé lui permet de nager plus rapidement qu’un champion de natation."},{"language":"es","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"La fuerza que le confiere toda la musculatura del cuerpo le permite nadar con tal impulso que puede rebasar hasta a nadadores profesionales."},{"language":"en","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"Swims powerfully using all the muscles in its body. It can even overtake world-class swimmers."},{"language":"ja","version":"lets-go-pikachu","text":"全身の 筋肉を 使った パワフルな 泳ぎで 世界レベルの 選手も 追い抜いていく。"},{"language":"fr","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"Son corps très musclé lui permet de nager plus rapidement qu’un champion de natation."},{"language":"es","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"La fuerza que le confiere toda la musculatura del cuerpo le permite nadar con tal impulso que puede rebasar hasta a nadadores profesionales."},{"language":"en","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"Swims powerfully using all the muscles in its body. It can even overtake world-class swimmers."},{"language":"ja","version":"lets-go-eevee","text":"全身の 筋肉を 使った パワフルな 泳ぎで 世界レベルの 選手も 追い抜いていく。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Cette véritable montagne de muscles peut se frayer un chemin même dans les eaux glaciales en éclatant la banquise avec ses bras robustes."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Su cuerpo es puro músculo. Logra abrirse paso por aguas gélidas partiendo el hielo con sus fornidos brazos."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"Its body is solid muscle. When swimming through cold seas, Poliwrath uses its impressive arms to smash through drift ice and plow forward."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"全身が 筋肉の 塊。 寒い 海でも たくましい 腕で 流氷を 砕き 突き進む。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Aussi habile à la nage qu’au combat, il peut donner de vigoureux coups de poing avec ses bras musclés."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"No solo es un experto nadador, sino que también domina las artes marciales. Propina enérgicos puñetazos gracias a sus musculosos brazos."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"Poliwrath is skilled at both swimming and martial arts. It uses its well-trained arms to dish out powerful punches."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"泳ぎ だけでなく 格闘技も 得意。 鍛えあげた 腕から 豪快な パンチを 繰りだす。"}],"varieties":[{"id":62,"moves":[{"name":"pound","learns":[[19,"level-up",1],[20,"level-up",1],[23,"level-up",1],[25,"egg",0]]},{"name":"double-slap","learns":[[1,"level-up",1],[2,"level-up",1],[3,"level-up",1],[4,"level-up",1],[5,"level-up",1],[6,"level-up",1],[7,"level-up",1],[8,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",1],[10,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",1],[12,"level-up",1],[13,"level-up",1],[14,"level-up",1],[15,"level-up",1],[16,"level-up",1],[17,"level-up",1],[18,"level-up",1],[28,"level-up",1],[29,"level-up",1]]},{"name":"mega-punch","learns":[[1,"machine",0],[2,"machine",0],[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0],[28,"machine",0],[29,"machine",0]]},{"name":"ice-punch","learns":[[3,"machine",0],[4,"machine",0],[6,"tutor",0],[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[19,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0],[25,"machine",0]]},{"name":"mega-kick","learns":[[1,"machine",0],[2,"machine",0],[6,"tutor",0],[7,"tutor",0],[20,"machine",0],[28,"machine",0],[29,"machine",0]]},{"name":"headbutt","learns":[[3,"machine",0],[4,"machine",0],[10,"tutor",0],[19,"machine",0]]},{"name":"body-slam","learns":